SUMMARY:Parent Academy NOVEMBER - Understanding ADHD: Insights for Parents & Caregivers
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an informative Parent Academy session featuring guest speaker Dr. Muhammad Zeshan (Dr. Z)\, a Harvard-trained child\, adolescent\, and adult psychiatrist. \nThis session will focus on Attention-Deficit/Hyperactivity Disorder (ADHD)\, offering parents and caregivers an opportunity to learn more about ADHD and gain insights from an expert mental health professional.
URL:https://www.mhainspire.org/event/understanding-adhd-insights-for-parents-caregivers/
LOCATION:Virtual
CATEGORIES:NJ4S
END:VEVENT
