SUMMARY:Family and Consumer Connection Group
DESCRIPTION:Family and Consumer Connection Group: Tuesdays 3pm to 4:30pm \nA professionally facilitated group where families and consumers come together to discuss and problem-solve challenges in a supportive environment. Goals of the group include providing support\, improving communication\, and strengthening socialization. This group meets on the 1st and 3rd Tuesday of the month from 3:00pm to 4:15pm. This is a closed group with limited spots\, and participation requires an orientation process. If you wish to participate in The Family and Consumer Connection group\, please reach out to Eileen Strungis at (973) 509-9777\, x 123\, or email her at estrungis@mhainspire.org.
URL:https://www.mhainspire.org/event/family-and-consumer-connection-group-3/2026-11-17/
LOCATION:Virtual
CATEGORIES:Support Groups
END:VEVENT
